# pip-audit ignore file (security.yml job `pip-audit`). It ships empty on purpose: prefer
# upgrading the package (`uv lock --upgrade-package <name>`) over ignoring a finding.
#
# Entry format: one advisory ID per line (PYSEC-..., GHSA-..., CVE-...) followed by an expiry
# date, after which the job fails until the entry is reviewed:
#
#   GHSA-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx exp:2027-01-31
#
# Every entry must be preceded by a comment that gives:
#   - the reason it is ignored,
#   - the owner who reviews it,
#   - a link to the advisory,
#   - why it is not exploitable here.
#
# Entries are reviewed when they expire. Lines that start with # and blank lines are ignored.
